        "title": "Privacy, the short version",
        "last_updated": "LAST UPDATED: AUGUST 2026",
        "content": "<p><strong>This is the short version.</strong> It covers what we collect and why, in plain English. Our <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\">full Privacy Policy</a> is the binding one, and it covers what this page doesn't: your legal rights, how long we keep data, international transfers, and how to complain.</p><h3>What We Collect</h3><p>When you place an order or create an account, we collect your name, email address, shipping address, and payment information. We also collect browsing data through cookies to improve your experience on our site.</p><h3>How We Use It</h3><p>We use your information to process and fulfill orders, send order updates, and if you opt in, share news and offers.</p><h3>Cookies</h3><p>Our site uses cookies to remember your preferences and understand how people use our site. You can disable cookies in your browser settings at any time.</p><h3>Advertising and Your Choices</h3><p>We don't sell your personal information for money. We do share some browsing data with advertising partners so the ads you see are more relevant, and under several state privacy laws that counts as a 'sale' or 'share.' You can opt out any time on our <a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\">Your Privacy Choices</a> page.</p><h3>Third Parties</h3><p>We work with trusted third-party services to process payments and fulfill orders. These partners only receive the information necessary to complete their service.</p><h3>Email / SMS Communications</h3><p>If you subscribe to our emails or SMS, you can unsubscribe at any time using the link at the bottom of any message.</p><h3>Your Data</h3><p>You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data at any time by contacting us at <a href=\"mailto:support@heist.co\">support@heist.co</a>.</p><h3>Changes To This Policy</h3><p>We may update this policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page.</p><h3>Read the full policy</h3><p>Everything above is a summary. The <a href=\"/policies/privacy-policy\">complete Privacy Policy</a> governs, and it has the full detail on your rights. Questions either way, reach us at <a href=\"mailto:support@heist.co\">support@heist.co</a>.</p>",
